=== step 4: drive the REAL runReviewLoop with that unprepared-env verification ===
stopReason              : verification_failed
closeable               : false
ROUNDS CONSUMED         : 2 of maxRounds=2
REVIEWER dispatched     : 0   <-- REVIEW NEVER HAPPENED
